{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"18a4636e2d361c524f852751426be2aad273019a25755555d3c22be7aad05251","ja":"ええっ、嘘でしょ！？\nなんでそんな大物を選んだんですか！？","zh":"诶，真的假的！？\n为什么会选那么厉害的大人物啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"007b129b565116b743c0c9a28e07da1e3ede7f7813a0d7136751ee043d7802e4","ja":"えへへ♪　これ、ボタンを押したらポチッて作れて\nとってもかわいいんですよ♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪　这个只要按一下按钮就能“啪”地做出来，\n超级可爱的哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8ad2ff11c39de0e0a11ac03ef2c752a640aaaa3000107d2e98238d4c0a106f7b","ja":"「こちらのワンタッチテント、45000円です！　\nなお、同店で3000円のミニテントもありました」","zh":"“这款秒开帐篷售价45000日元！　\n另外，同一家店里还有3000日元的迷你帐篷”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c825b51a8dc9d4198499dc0598881e6f3d15b7bb88542dd2cdd62a643d4be5a3","ja":"あ、そうだったんですね？　\nでも私は、このテントが一番だと思いま～す♪","zh":"啊，原来是这样吗？　\n不过我觉得，这个帐篷才是最棒的～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"804480c5aea8f01f0a79a64b31bfb303b38220a3d39f35bb923d8614a872b31d","ja":"よ、良かったですね……。\nえっと、それでエレナは何を選んだの？","zh":"太、太好了呢……。\n那个，所以艾莲娜选了什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"87648996d9f54a63bda5eb0e7af6fe665f7a8a17125bc3f225aa2e27747da9d1","ja":"ワタシはグリーンのワンピースだヨ！\nそれと、この羽のついたキレイな帽子。","zh":"我是绿色的连衣裙哦！\n还有这顶带着羽毛的漂亮帽子。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9b51c40955c6b9752a574da66fd31fd27591f7ea79e1f744cd6868b7d370f0fd","ja":"……えっ、全部で10000円？　帽子が7000円なノ？\nエヘヘ、ちょっと欲張りすぎちゃったネ！","zh":"……咦，一共10000日元？帽子要7000日元吗？\n嘿嘿，稍微有点太贪心了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"524f432560f8b2cd51c8b04860dc0280484c68d96d50d200987bbb21c4c77cd9","ja":"ワンピースだけなら3000円ジャストじゃない……\nえ？　スタジオでは大ウケ……！？","zh":"如果只要这件连衣裙的话，不是正好3000日元嘛……\n哎？在演播室里大受欢迎……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"499b1478451bb05d7a450bf541870b9e234562cdfdb56ce936d0bd4c3a4bd0a8","ja":"麗花とエレナのチョイスに、周りやスタジオで\n笑いが起こり、番組収録は終了した……","zh":"丽花和艾莲娜的选择引来了周围和演播室里的\n阵阵笑声，节目收录也就此结束……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b880d751cdbd530fa92216fdd4f1ae9357cb95e930bbccd5262cc4025b98a383","ja":"はぁ……試合に勝って、勝負に負けた気分だわ。\n優勝したのに、すっかり霞んじゃったわね……。","zh":"唉……感觉就像赢了比赛，却输了较量一样。\n明明拿了冠军，风头却全被盖过去了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"78ee55a0291cf4022fd982ebe51341c3065579bcf59cec7f0c03609b0a529705","ja":"そうかナ？\nリツコのデート服、すっごくキュートだったヨ♪","zh":"是吗？\n律子的约会服超可爱的唷♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"460ff380d2a97aacf1ab478b1a28118826511c25803f893b9ae3e3a3aaa4279c","ja":"エレナちゃんの帽子もね！\n私、ふたりのセンス、大好き♪","zh":"艾莲娜的帽子也是呢！\n我超喜欢你们两个的品味♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"84cabd6103405b2d9b6e47c3687ee8c67ca1d182032c7e4eb1846b6cb2888a24","ja":"ねぇ、今から3人でお買い物しましょ！","zh":"呐，我们现在3个人一起去买东西吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"68c610539471ba3903ab61a0ed56bdacf699279ffbb46b4ef243ec0b5d1d61f5","ja":"エヘヘッ、ワタシも行きたかったんダ♪\nふたりにぴったりのアイテムを見つけたんだヨ！","zh":"嘿嘿，我也想去呀♪\n我找到了非常适合两人的道具哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1127.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"4c659767f9ef1a152061968068c37877b3ab439fac5a493a0da5a8998498c451","ja":"……ふふっ、そうね。じゃあ行きましょうか。\nふたりが何を選ぶか、とっても楽しみだわ♪","zh":"……呵呵，也是呢。那我们走吧。\n我很期待你们两个会选什么哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
